: [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788570655761915585,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"15d16fcc-497a-402a-b4cd-6b07418167db","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"24cb-6ed5-658a-4ca6"},{"link_uuid":"d894936f-48b2-46b7-942a-c915aaa626b6","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"2992-af5d-3bb5-42d3"},{"link_uuid":"8bab1b51-3dcd-4e3c-985c-a4c8fa6b329c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"3edb-6b89-29cc-46e3"},{"link_uuid":"ce648807-e4cf-4869-b2f1-3729abb3dd23","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7699-28ee-23a4-4ee3"},{"link_uuid":"5f1699a6-0f82-425b-9078-f11ab5107426","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"04ca-92be-ba1f-4f9a"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/_engine_support/reads.py:1-23, 54-56, 120-165, 226-234, 276-281, 322-335, 362-365, 417-464, 581-585` — Preserve the shared read implementation, lean-list contract, and query semantics. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/attest/authorship_resolution.py:119-154, 213-243, 293-315` — Preserve oldest-introducing-commit semantics and batched complexity. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/graph/_links.py:127-147` — Preserve the canonical locked append seam. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/opcert_service/app.py:1-20, 59-66` — Preserve async job API, guard authentication, and app-owned executor shutdown property. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/opcert_service/workspace.py:23-39` — Preserve bounded git calls and the shorter boot-lock budget. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine_support/reads.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/attest/authorship_resolution.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/graph/_links.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/opcert_service/app.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/opcert_service/workspace.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"8c04-ae95-b307-450b","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in src/rebar — cohort 02: reads–workspace","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["82ed9f3b-37ac-4502-8761-bc4ab40ed18b","d8953ac4-5159-45b4-bc9c-62e9081a889f","15d16fcc-497a-402a-b4cd-6b07418167db","d894936f-48b2-46b7-942a-c915aaa626b6","8bab1b51-3dcd-4e3c-985c-a4c8fa6b329c","ce648807-e4cf-4869-b2f1-3729abb3dd23","5f1699a6-0f82-425b-9078-f11ab5107426"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788582737501734001,"uuid":"7a24cb42-7508-4e01-8f0c-0c917e27c7a1"}